  bug rate   runs needed to see it at least once, 95% of the time
       50%        5
       20%       14
        5%       59
        1%      299

  a 1-in-20 bug that was never fixed passes  10 runs in a row 60% of the time
  a 1-in-20 bug that was never fixed passes  30 runs in a row 21% of the time
  a 1-in-20 bug that was never fixed passes 100 runs in a row 1% of the time

the rule of three: after n clean runs, the bug rate is below about 3/n
   10 clean runs -> rate under 30.0%, 95% confidence
   60 clean runs -> rate under 5.0%, 95% confidence
  300 clean runs -> rate under 1.0%, 95% confidence
